<title>UK: State Bank NSW sets A$100 million five-year bond.</title>
<headline>State Bank NSW sets A$100 million five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Hambros Bank Ltd.</p>
<p> BORROWER   STATE BANK OF NEW SOUTH WALES</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  GOVERNOR OF STATE OF NEW SOUTH WALES</p>
<p> AMT	A$100 MLN   COUPON     6.75	MATURITY    14.JAN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.10    PAY DATE    14.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/AU</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  AUSTRALIA TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  1.50	PRAECIPUUM  0.125</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
